    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Number of new databases for monitoring and recording issued foreign trade licenses.
- Number of law enforcement agencies to which the SALW Identification Tool has been deployed
- Number of joint exercises organized and implemented
- Number of analyses &#x2013; assessments aimed at digitalization of processes and systems within the law enforcement agencies
