    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall indicator: BiH Customs lacks the appropriate training, knowledge, operational assets and equipment to detect the illicit arms at BiH Border Points.
- One National SALW Transport Database at the Ministry of Security developed and operational.
- SALW Identification Tool improved and deployed within the Border Police of BiH 
- Six (6) joint exercises organized within CIAT and HALT projects
- Absence of any targeted assessment regarding SALW related digital systems
- None of the projects developed during the training within PILLAR+ project have been implemented</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
